@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L3：消费解码与业务异常分支

participant Provider
participant MessageTemplate
participant MessageWireCodec
participant MessageContextAccessor as Context
participant MessageHandler

Provider -> MessageTemplate: onMessage(inbound)
MessageTemplate -> MessageWireCodec: decode

alt 必填系统头缺失
  MessageWireCodec --> MessageTemplate: IllegalArgumentException
  MessageTemplate --> Provider: RETRY
else 逻辑目的地不匹配
  MessageWireCodec --> MessageTemplate: IllegalArgumentException
  MessageTemplate --> Provider: RETRY
else content-type 不支持
  MessageWireCodec --> MessageTemplate: IllegalArgumentException
  MessageTemplate --> Provider: RETRY
else payload 反序列化失败
  MessageWireCodec --> MessageTemplate: exception
  MessageTemplate --> Provider: RETRY
else 解码成功
  MessageWireCodec --> MessageTemplate: DecodedInbound
  MessageTemplate -> Context: open(CurrentMessage)
  MessageTemplate -> MessageHandler: handle
  alt Handler 返回 null
    MessageHandler --> MessageTemplate: null
    MessageTemplate -> Context: close
    MessageTemplate --> Provider: RETRY
  else Handler 抛异常
    MessageHandler --> MessageTemplate: exception
    MessageTemplate -> Context: close
    MessageTemplate --> Provider: RETRY
  else Handler 正常返回
    MessageHandler --> MessageTemplate: SUCCESS / RETRY
    MessageTemplate -> Context: close
    MessageTemplate --> Provider: decision
  end
end

note over MessageTemplate
当前图仍是消费一期异常策略：保守 RETRY。
消费可靠性、最大重试、毒消息和 DLQ 是后续阶段。
end note
@enduml
